        "criticalFormula": "$F_x(x) = -\\frac{\\mathrm{d}E_p}{\\mathrm{d}x}$ ; Équilibre stable : $\\left(\\frac{\\mathrm{d}E_p}{\\mathrm{d}x}\\right)_{x_{\\text{eq}}} = 0$ et $\\left(\\frac{\\mathrm{d}^2E_p}{\\mathrm{d}x^2}\\right)_{x_{\\text{eq}}} > 0$",
