        ],
        "keyFormula": "$C_{\\text{PI}}(p) = K_p\\left(1 + \\frac{1}{T_i\\,p}\\right) \\implies \\text{Classe FTBO } \\alpha \\ge 1 \\implies \\varepsilon_\\infty = 0$",
